Suppose the university newspaper is inviting submissions from the students for its coming edition on a campus event that has impressed them most.
You are now to write an essay for submission.

###
  Nowadays, various campus activities have become a common phenomenon. Among them, What impressed me most is volunteer activities. As far as I am concerned, that is extremely
meaningful and worthy.
	For one thing, this event brings us a precious experience. We cleaned the streets and taught the children in remote areas and took care of the elders. We took part in the labor
in person and got a precious experience. For another, this activities inspires us a lot. When we got the house of that remote childen and saw them studying under the dark light, 
which leted us know that our present life is so precious and inspired us to contribute to our country.
	From my perspective, we should do more voluntary activities to help people in trouble and build our country. Only in this way can we keep the world filling of warmth and make 
lives better.


### 逐处错误标注（带序号）
1. What impressed me most → what impressed me most （从句内部不用大写 W）
2. that is extremely meaningful → they are extremely meaningful （指代 volunteer activities，复数，用 they）
3. this activities → this activity /these activities （this + 单数；these + 复数）
4. got the house of that remote childen → visited the house of those remote children；childen → children（拼写错误）
5. which leted us know → which let us know；leted 是错误变形，let 过去式还是 let
6. keep the world filling of warmth → keep the world full of warmth 固定搭配：be full of（充满）


### 语法修正版（只改错误，保留你原本句子思路）
  Nowadays, various campus activities have become a common phenomenon. Among them, what impressed me most is volunteer activities. As far as I am concerned, they are extremely 
meaningful and worthy.
  For one thing, this event brings us precious experience. We cleaned streets, taught children in remote areas and looked after the elderly. We took part in labor in person and
gained valuable experience. For another, this activity inspires us a lot. When we visited the house of those remote children and saw them studying under dim light, it let us 
know that our present life is so precious and inspired us to contribute to our country.
  From my perspective, we should take part in more voluntary activities to help people in need and serve our country. Only in this way can we keep the world full of warmth and 
improve people’s lives.


### 优化完整版（四级高分表达，词数约 152）
  Nowadays, various campus activities have become a common phenomenon. Among them, what impressed me most is volunteer activities. As far as I am concerned, they are extremely 
meaningful and worthy of our participation.
  For one thing, this event brings us precious practical experience. We cleaned streets, gave lessons to kids in remote areas and cared for the elderly. By taking part in labor
in person, we can feel the real needs of other people. For another, this activity inspires us deeply. When we visited those children’s homes and saw them studying under dim light,
we realized how precious our life is. It motivates us to make contributions to our country.
  From my perspective, we should join more voluntary activities to help people in need. Only in this way can we keep the world full of warmth and create a better life for others.
